OL,3,GNEWSAOne person taken to hospital after
OL,4,Aflats fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter breathing in smoke and residents
OL,8,Fwere forced to leave their homes after
OL,9,Fa fire broke out in a block of flats.
OL,11,FCrews from 11 Berkshire fire stations
OL,12,Falong with five from Buckinghamshire
OL,13,Fwere sent to the flats on High Street,
OL,14,FMaidenhead, at about 21:40 BST on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FFirefighters worked with Thames Valley
OL,18,FPolice to get residents to safety as
OL,19,Fcrews worked to tackle the fire, which
OL,20,Fhad spread into the roof space of the
OL,21,Fbuilding, Royal Berkshire Fire and
OL,22,FRescue Service (RBFRS) said.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
